# ISBNnet Resolver environment variable key list.
# This file lists key names only — no real values.
#
# Wrangler doesn't read .env itself: for local dev, copy these keys into
# .dev.vars (wrangler dev loads it automatically; it's gitignored).
# In deployed environments, set secrets with `wrangler secret put <NAME>` —
# never write them to a file.

# ---- Optional (unset = lookups stay open to anyone) ----
# Shared secret the UniBooks backend sends in the X-Resolver-Secret header.
# When set, an /isbn/ lookup without the same value gets 401; /health stays
# open. Must exactly match UniBooks-BE's ISBNNET_RESOLVER_SECRET.
# Production: set the backend's ISBNNET_RESOLVER_SECRET and deploy it first,
# then: wrangler secret put ISBNNET_RESOLVER_SECRET
ISBNNET_RESOLVER_SECRET=
